---
import BrandMark from './BrandMark.astro';
---
<figure class="build-loop not-prose">
  <div class="loop-grid">
    <div><span class="loop-number">01</span><strong>You define the result</strong><p>“Find orders that lose money after shipping. Keep unknown quotes visible.”</p></div>
    <span class="loop-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <div><span class="loop-marks"><BrandMark name="codex" /><BrandMark name="claude-code" /></span><strong>Your agent writes the worker</strong><p>Source in your language, pinned dependencies, and SQL assertions.</p></div>
    <span class="loop-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <div><BrandMark name="duckdb" /><strong>DuckDB checks the result</strong><p>Attach the real program. Compare actual rows with the expected answer.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="repair-path"><span aria-hidden="true">↶</span><p><strong>But a test can fail.</strong> The error goes back to the agent. It repairs the implementation and reruns the check.</p></div>
  <figcaption>You keep the source and tests. Once built, the worker answers queries without a coding agent in the request path.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .build-loop { margin:2rem 0; color:var(--color-soil-900); }.loop-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 30px 1fr 30px 1fr; align-items:start; gap:1rem; }.loop-grid>div { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.7rem; min-width:0; border-top:2px solid var(--color-soil-300); padding-top:1.2rem; }.loop-grid strong { font-size:.95rem; }.loop-grid p { font-size:.85rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0; color:var(--color-soil-700); }.loop-number { font-size:.9rem; color:var(--color-sun-700); height:22px; }.loop-marks { display:flex; gap:.6rem; }.loop-arrow { padding-top:3.5rem; color:var(--color-soil-600); font-size:1.3rem; }.repair-path { display:flex; gap:1rem; align-items:center; border-bottom:2px dashed var(--color-soil-400); margin:1rem 0 0 auto; padding:.75rem 0; max-width:66%; }.repair-path>span { font-size:2rem; color:var(--color-field-700); }.repair-path p { margin:0; font-size:.8rem; line-height:1.7; color:var(--color-soil-700); }.build-loop figcaption { margin-top:1.25rem; font-size:.8rem; line-height:1.7; color:var(--color-soil-600); }
  @media(max-width:600px) { .loop-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:.5rem; }.loop-arrow { transform:rotate(90deg); padding:0; text-align:center; }.repair-path { max-width:100%; } }
</style>
